        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 510,
        "paragraph_id": "299BC61E",
        "text": "In the Manning formulation the Manning coefficient (n) must be specified. The dimensionless friction coefficient is calculated from (2.54). Manning can be seen as a depth-dependent Chézy value and a typical Manning value for sandy coasts would be in the order of 0.02 s/m1/3."
